OL,3,GNEWSAGrooming gangs inquiry expanded to
OL,4,ABirmingham and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is unclear whether further locations
OL,7,Fwill be selected. Some survivors have
OL,8,Fexpressed frustration that their area
OL,9,Fhas not yet been included and said they
OL,10,Fwere concerned about expanding the
OL,11,Finquiry's scope.
